        <h2>Why the Digital Nomad Visa is Perfect for UK Remote Workers</h2>
        <p>Post-Brexit, UK citizens need a proper visa to live and work in Spain. The Digital Nomad Visa was designed for remote professionals like you—offering stability, tax advantages, and legal certainty without requiring a traditional Spanish employment contract.</p>
