        <li><strong>ACRO Certificate:</strong> Criminal record disclosure from the UK Home Office (Applied Criminal Records Office). Valid for 6 months; order it online at acro.police.uk. Cost: approximately £10-£20.</li>
        <li><strong>FCDO Apostille:</strong> Your ACRO certificate must be apostilled (certified as genuine) by the Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office. This is crucial—Spanish consulates will not accept an un-apostilled ACRO. Processed by post; typically 2-3 weeks.</li>
