        <p><strong>Borderline Cases:</strong> If your income is close to the threshold (£23,500-£24,500), supplement your evidence with several months of bank statements showing consistent deposits, a letter from your employer/clients confirming ongoing work, and your latest tax return. Consulates have some discretion with borderline applicants who demonstrate stable income.</p>
